      "id": "prologue",
      "title": "Prologue",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "titleblock-div-0",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-title-block\">\n        <h1>CARTOON PORTRAITS AND BIOGRAPHICAL SKETCHES OF MEN OF THE DAY</h1>\n        <h2>BY MARK TWAIN</h2>\n\n    </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "prologue-div-1",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-text-content\"> <span>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <p><span>CARTOON PORTRAITS</span> </p>\n                <p><span>AND</span> </p>\n                <p>Biographical Sketches </p>\n                <p><span>OF</span> </p>\n                <p><span>MEN OF THE DAY.</span> </p>\n                <p>THE DRAWINGS BY <a href=\"/wiki/Author:Frederick_Waddy\" title=\"Author:Frederick Waddy\">FREDERICK\n                        WADDY</a>. </p>\n                <hr style=\"color:inherit;width:5em;\" />\n                <p> <span>LONDON:<br />TINSLEY BROTHERS, 18 CATHERINE STREET, STRAND.<br />1873.</span> </p>\n            </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-raw-2",
          "text": "</div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "prologue-div-3",
          "text": "<div class=\"block-center\"> <span>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <p><span>NOTE.</span> </p>\n            </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-4",
          "text": "With one exception, the likeness in profile of Lord Lytton, the Cartoon Portraits of Men of the Day—for\n                the most part those of literary celebrities—comprised in this volume have appeared during the past year\n                as illustrations in 'Once a Week.' Biographical sketches accompanied the cartoons in the pages of the\n                magazine; and in collecting and republishing the portraits in a separate and more permanent form, it has\n                not been thought necessary to make any material alterations in the notices that originally accompanied\n                them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-raw-5",
          "text": "</div>\n    </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-6",
          "text": "<span>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
