phical sketches of men of the day/Robert Browning\">Robert\n                        Browning</a> </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">12 </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/G._E._Street,_R.A.\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/G. E. Street, R.A.\">G. E.\n                        Street, R.A.</a> </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">18 </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>'<a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/Mr._Speaker\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/Mr. Speaker\">Mr.\n                        Speaker</a>' </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">20 </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/J._L._Toole\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/J. L. Toole\">J. L.\n                        Toole</a> </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">22 </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/Gustave_Dor%C3%A9\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/Gustave Doré\">Gustave\n                        Doré</a> </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">26 </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/William_Morris\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/William Morris\">William\n                        Morris</a> </td>\n                <td style=\"text-ali