es of men of the day/Frederick Locker\">Frederick\n                        Locker</a>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">118\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/Mark_Twain\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/Mark Twain\">Mark Twain</a>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">122\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/H._M._Stanley\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/H. M. Stanley\">H. M.\n                        Stanley</a>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">124\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/J._A._Froude\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/J. A. Froude\">J. A.\n                        Froude</a>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">126\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/Shirley_Brooks\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches of men of the day/Shirley Brooks\">Shirley\n                        Brooks</a>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;\">128\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><a href=\"/wiki/Cartoon_portraits_and_biographical_sketches_of_men_of_the_day/Dean_Stanley\"\n                        title=\"Cartoon portraits and biographical sketches o